l-keymaps[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel-shell: build the modal, the nested note rail, the note card, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]filtering, scope cycling and picking, empty/error states, and passive [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]open/copy actions.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parent and child link travel[/bold #D7AFFF]                                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]panel-links[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel-shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel-links: add the numbered PARENT/CHILDREN chips, chip cursor, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]numbered follow, and the bounded breadcrumb trail with back travel.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add, edit, delete, and publish surfaces[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel-mutations[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel-shell, memory-writes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel-mutations: wire the add/edit forms, the delete confirmation, the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked-proc writes, and the sase memory init publish flow with its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unpublished state.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Prompt gm and Ctrl+G m entry point[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]prompt-entry[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel-shell[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt-entry: claim the prompt g-prefix m continuation, post the request[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]message, open the panel seeded from the memory reference under the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cursor, and restore focus.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation, visual snapshots, and full verification[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on 